{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t港股午後跌幅擴大，恒生指數一度失守23000點關口，低見22983點，跌近230點，收市報23041點，跌170點，跌幅0.7%，主板成交額逾1783億元。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n滙控中午公布業績，下午股價最多跌近7%，收市跌近6%，報134.3元。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n龍湖集團跌逾7%，是跌幅最大藍籌股。李寧升近6%，是升幅最大恒指成份股。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n科技指數收市報3800點，跌幅近1.5%。部分人工智能概念及晶片股逆市造好，智譜升近9%。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:42:13.292545+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T08:21:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T19:39:18.909615+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T08:38:40.044772+00:00","content_hash":"6ab4ef83f9db3bf14d42883a45e50a3233afff8f7fef979efe398fce86599e77","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}